<p>Decimal 36864. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>HSCROLL_REGISTER</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Horizontal position of the screen, and interlace.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bit 7 - interlace scan bit</li>
<li>Bits 6-0 - horizontal position of the first character column</li>
</ul>
